@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Terminal Operator" as OPERATOR
participant ":System" as System
participant "WMS" as WMS

activate OPERATOR

OPERATOR -> System : requests to unload wagons (wagons.csv)
activate System
System --> OPERATOR : confirms file loaded successfully

System -> WMS : parse wagons.csv (read SKU, expiryDate, receivedAt, boxId)
activate WMS
WMS --> System : returns structured wagon data
deactivate WMS

System -> WMS : assign boxes to aisles/bays by FEFO/FIFO rules
activate WMS
note right
    Sorting priority:
    (a) expiryDate (earliest first; null last)
    (b) receivedAt (oldest first)
    (c) boxId ASC (tie-break)
end note
WMS --> System : stores box locations and updates inventory
deactivate WMS

System -> WMS : record unloading operation in movement log
activate WMS
WMS --> System : confirms movement registered
deactivate WMS

System --> OPERATOR : informs successful unloading and storage summary
deactivate System
deactivate OPERATOR

@enduml

